		line=1332,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"During a break between classes, Kanami invites me to a secluded spot away from prying eyes.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Here, she tells me what happened to her in the Imperial Palace yesterday.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Though I have no definitive proof, I believe Elsa-sama is intending to betray the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“She was unusually agitated when discussing this matter with the chancellor.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You did well to tell me.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Of course, there is the possibility that Elsa really was telling the truth, and all this was just an excuse to seize the rights to palace security.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"But I want to believe in Kanami's observational skills.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Continue keeping an eye on her.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But take care to not let her realize our suspicions.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“As you wish.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Also, though I am ashamed to report this, I must confess that I was unable to learn anything about the Three Sacred Treasures.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The maidservants in the palace do not appear to know where a pavilion called the Shireiden might even be located.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Seems like both Okonogi and Elsa are both onto you, so\nit's probably best to lay low for a while.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Right, I will.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Though I must admit, I never expected that even Elsa-sama would be monitoring me.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Oh, but I am betraying her after all, so I suppose that means she must have a sharp sense for danger.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry. I wish I didn't have to put you through all this.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“No, I am doing it gladly. All for you, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Kanami reverently lowers her head to me.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"What could my past self have ever done to deserve such dedicated devotion from her?",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Though, if it would assuage your guilt, might your Kanami make a request of her Onii-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your requests scare me.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Last time, it nearly upset the entire fate of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I do not ask for much.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It need only be for a short time, but would you steal me away?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Steal you away?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Take me out to the city.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I wish for you to whisk me away on a secret tryst, just like the dashing protagonist in a romance novel.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, even scarier than I imagined.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Is that too much to ask?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Too genuine to ever be calculated, she entreats me with her upturned, slightly moist eyes.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"I can't imagine any man would find it easy to say no to her like this.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Give me some time.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll figure out a way to make it happen.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Do you truly mean it?!”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't get your hopes up too much.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes! I'll be sure to get my hopes up an entirely reasonable amount!”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Unable to contain her joy, Kanami excitedly bounces up and down on the spot.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Ah, what am I ever going to do with her?",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Come to think of it, how has Miyaguni-sama been?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Still the same, ever since our fight at the beach.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"I suppose she ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"would",
{"/font"},
" be mad that her vassal disobeyed her direct orders.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"She hasn't so much as spoken to me since that day.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Hence, I'm the only one escorting Kanami today.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am delighted that the two of us can be alone together, but it pains my heart at the same time.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is between me and Akari. You don't need to worry about it.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If only that were the case...”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Oh? Over there, could that be...?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Speak of the─well, I wouldn't dare call her that.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Even so, she does just happen to be walking down the hall right at this moment, likely heading toward her next class.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"I'm reminded of this whenever I see her, but her gallant and regal bearing truly is a sight to behold.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“How beautiful she is.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait a minute. Who's that...?”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Someone is stalking up to her from behind.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"All alone, I head for my next class.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"The familiar sight of Soujin by my side is nowhere to be seen.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Ever since the day I handed him over to Empress Hisui, I\nhaven't been able to shake this sense of loss, as though\nI've had my favorite blanket snatched away from me.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Ah, I'm so pissed.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"And the fact that I don't know what I'm so pissed about pisses me off even more.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Is it because Soujin dared to disobey my command?",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Because Kanami seemed so unreasonably happy about it all?",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Or could it be that I actually─",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"I shake my head in a panic.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"The two of us are master and servant.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"It's unconscionable for there to be any special feelings between a lord and her vassal.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Soujin even said it himself.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Ah, man.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"What am I even thinking?",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Woman's Voice"},
			{
"“Don't move.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nh?!”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"I flinch involuntarily.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"A hard object is pressed right against my back.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Elsa, right? This some prank or what?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Make a scene and I'll shoot.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"She pushes the object even more firmly against me.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"...I let my guard down.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"My mind was full of nothing but thoughts about Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Walk to the student council office.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All right.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"We walk just like that for some time before arriving at the student council office.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Is this how you Republicans greet people first thing in the morning?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Only once in a blue moon.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“For example, when dealing with certain blue-blooded individuals.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You flatter me. That, or you're mistaking me for someone else.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yes, I certainly was up until now.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Do I have to spell it out for you, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Your",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Imperial Highness?",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"At this, my hair immediately stands on end.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What're you talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Think you can fool me?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I told you. You're mistaking me for someone else.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"My whole body is stiff with tension.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"It takes everything I have to keep my voice from trembling.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Be a dear and stop wasting my time, won't you?”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've got plenty of ways to make you talk if I really wanted to.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Answer me while I'm still in a good mood, and things'll go much better for you.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"She digs the hard object further into my back.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"It's all over for me if I get arrested.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"I have to get away somehow.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari!”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!?”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"I lock eyes with Soujin as he barges into the room.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hold it right there!”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Elsa shouts from behind my back.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Soujin comes to a halt right in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Wouldn't want anything bad to happen to Her Highness, would you?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Drop your gun.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And what if I don't?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Try me.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Soujin and Elsa stand off against each other, with me in the middle.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If you tell me who Miyaguni-san really is, I'll let her go right away.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I have no idea what you're talking about.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, isn't that a problem.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Behind me, I hear an ominous metallic click.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Haah... haah...! Onii-sama, please wait for me...”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"This time, it's Kanami who bursts through the door.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Her shoulders are heaving, as though she sprinted all the way here.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh dear, Tokita-kun, leaving Empress Hisui all unattended like that.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let Akari go this instant!”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Soujin glares daggers at Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Even though it's not even directed at me, his withering gaze is sharp enough to make me cower.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"He's seriously angry.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehehee, I've never seen you make a face like that before.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Don't you worry. I'll let her go.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Go on, Your Highness. Your ≪knight≫ is waiting for you.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"The pressure against my back suddenly disappears.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"I immediately rush towards Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"As soon as she is freed, I seize Akari by the arm and pull her in right next to me.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari! Are you okay?”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, what is the meaning of this?”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Elsa brandishes the object in her hands for us to see.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"It's nothing but an ordinary fountain pen.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It wasn't a gun?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The student council president can't just be waving a gun around willy-nilly, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"She smugly smiles at us before tucking the fountain pen in her breast pocket.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"She had the two of us completely fooled.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"Elsa pulls out a nearby chair and sits down.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"She leisurely crosses her legs, as if showing off her own self-assuredness.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, I never would have expected that Miyaguni-san would be the real Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've got the wrong girl.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun's desperation just now is all the proof I need.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're deluding yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Then tell me, why did Empress Hisui suddenly start looking into the Three Sacred Treasures?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What need does someone like you have for them?”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I told you─it was merely a whim of curiosity.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Onii-sama put you up to it, didn't he?”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Besides, you said it yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“'Miyaguni-sama ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"would never allow",
{"/font"},
" me to elope with\nOnii-sama,' was it?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why would you ever need Miyaguni-san's permission? It's not like she's going out with Tokita-kun, is it?”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Kanami can't bring herself to meet Elsa's gaze.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Her guilty expression is telling her that she's right on the money.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What a big problem this has turned into.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You and Inou-san already knew Empress Hisui was an impostor when you decided to go along with Operation Bellflower, didn't you?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Which means you've been lying to me this whole time.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tell me, how am I ever supposed to trust you now?”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Elsa pointedly looks between me and Akari in turn.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"If she walks away now, the entire operation falls apart.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Akari will be hunted as a fugitive, and Elsa will go right back to showing the warriors no quarter.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, take Kanami and go back to class.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Akari seats herself down right across from Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll take an absence.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...All right.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"I sit down beside her.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"After some hesitation, Kanami sits down as well.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“My identity is just as you suspect.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll start by apologizing for hiding it all this time.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Akari's eyes seem to express genuine contrition.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ever since we first met, I could tell you were no ordinary student.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's no small feat to slip through our net for three whole years.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Elsa leans forward, uncrossing her legs.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Let me get straight to the point. Does your side intend to move forward with Operation Bellflower?”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"I'm tempted to interject, but I decide to leave this to Akari.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, really now?”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If all goes according to plan, there'll be a new regime with Empress Hisui at its head.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Would the legitimate successor ever allow a false Empress to lay claim to the throne?”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you and Kanami promise to build a peaceful and prosperous country, then I'll forget all about my claim.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"She lays it out straight.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You expect me to believe that?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Aren't you a family of absolute monarchs who've ruled the Empire for over two thousand years?”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“There's no way you'd possibly give up your power so easily.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Imperial Family has no desire to reign for its own sake.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Our sole duty is to protect the land's harvests and the\npeople's prosperity.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As if. There's no such thing as a ruler who doesn't lust for power.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Maybe you Republicans can't understand it, since you come from a world where everyone has to win power by their own hand.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But in the first place, we don't even consider ourselves as rulers.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Empire's true sovereign is none but Oomikami, and we merely watch over the land in His stead.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Imperial Family are nothing more than His faithful servants.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's just the rhetoric you use to legitimate your own authority. I've heard it all before.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You petty despots are a dime a dozen.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're welcome to not believe it, but we of the Imperial Family very much do.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The only thing my mother ever taught me was this:”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Those born to the Imperial Family must fulfill their sacred duty as sovereigns. If they should ever fail to do so, they are to return these lands to Oomikami.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's all.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She never once raised me to cling onto the Imperial\nFamily's power.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Even to the very end, Akari speaks with a calm serenity.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Her words contain no hint of affectation or pretense.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Her simple declarations carry all the force of one stating their beliefs as a matter of fact.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And so you can rest assured that if you and Empress Hisui manage to create a peaceful and prosperous country, I would gladly step aside.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If introducing democracy would better protect the\ncountry's peace, then I couldn't ask for anything more.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Besides, our family is as worthless as they come, not even being able to protect the Empire from the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't have any attachment, let alone any right to the throne.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Just as all those born as warriors strive to fulfill their humble purpose, so too do those born of the Imperial Family.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Whether Emperors or warriors or artisans or farmers, all of\nOomikami's children simply carry out the roles He has ordained for them.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"As such, the Imperial Family has always reigned with virtue, never once being led astray by profane or worldly interests.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"And so, even as the rightful successor to the throne, Akari would gladly cast aside her claim for the sake of the people.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"So this is the noble heart possessed by those of the Imperial Family.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"How proud I am to have her as my lord.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Akari, I made the right choice to serve you.)”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"The girl sitting beside me radiates the nobility of a true Empress with her every word and action.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Kanami surely feels the same way.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Her gaze is quietly focused on her own lap as a show of respect to her rightful sovereign.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's some impressive sophistry.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's impossible for humans to resist their true nature!”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No matter how grand and lofty your ideals, any system you build will be sullied by the muck of reality eventually.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“People can no more resist their base desires than water can resist the pull of gravity!”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's why we fight.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's why we struggle so desperately, lest we ever sink into that muck.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I remember now... Tokita-kun once said the same thing to me.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Empress is just as foolish as her warriors, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The whole lot of you, fighting so desperately for things that won't profit you in the slightest.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"Elsa can't help but let out a small sigh.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Very well, Miyaguni-san. I'll take you at your word.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You have my gratitude, Elsa.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Can I take this to mean that we will proceed with the operation as planned?”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Not quite. The only one I trust is Miyaguni-san.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How am I supposed to continue cooperating with the warriors after you've lied to me this whole time?”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"Elsa looks pointedly at me.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"She's telling me to give her a reason to trust us.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"Hotori isn't around, so I'll have to figure this out myself.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I believe we had an agreement where you'd return us the spellblades that you confiscated.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Right, I remember.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“To be clear, we still expect you to hold up that bargain.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll carry out the exchange at the Sworn Blades headquarters.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"Akari turns to look at me in shock.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The warriors you know of as the Sworn Blades are alive and well.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course, Hotori and I are among their ranks.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, my. Are you certain that you should be telling me all this?”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"Elsa doesn't appear shocked in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"I'm sure she already suspected as much.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Once we show you the location of our headquarters, our lives will essentially be in your hands.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Surely you have plenty of other bases, don't you?”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, just the one.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You're kidding!”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And so, there's nothing more that we can give you.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You won't be able to get away from us anymore, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"Elsa coldly declares, narrowing her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we go along with Operation Bellflower, you'd be holding our lives in your hands anyway.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Isn't there a part of you, deep down, that wants to eliminate us as soon as we've disposed of Okonogi?”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"Elsa's ultramarine eyes waver ever so slightly.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, don't take me too seriously.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You shouldn't throw around such scary accusations.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This means we have no intentions of playing cat and mouse any longer.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"Elsa steeples her hands on top of the table.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I suppose you deserve to have your determination acknowledged.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Let's continue to move forward as planned.”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Once we confirm the drop-off location, we'll return the spellblades.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"I scrawl the location of our headquarters on a piece of paper and hand it over to Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"The Sworn Blades might as well be a prisoner awaiting execution now.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Confirm the veracity of the information ASAP. This is top priority.”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"I end the transmission with my subordinate.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"My chest is surging with an indescribable sense of excitement.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"The location contained on this note is very likely genuine.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"This means that the Sworn Blades are completely defenseless. I could raid their headquarters as early as today if I wanted to.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"Because of the warriors' own deception, I was able to drag out this critical information from them before their uprising.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we go along with Operation Bellflower, you'd be holding our lives in your hands anyway.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Isn't there a part of you, deep down, that wants to eliminate us as soon as we've disposed of Okonogi?”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"You're exactly right, Tokita-kun.",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"I can't believe you're staying aboard this operation even though you've already seen through my true intentions.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"I take a sip of the tea I brewed earlier, but it leaves an unpleasant bitter aftertaste in my mouth.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"How strange. My conscience is making a coward of me.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"If I didn't have my position to consider, I certainly wouldn't say I hated the warriors.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"In fact, I'm even rather fond of them.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"The way that they live, the way that they constantly question the sincerity of their fealty─it's nothing short of dazzling.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"And meanwhile, here I am intending to stab them in the back.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"Of course, I can't just pardon the warriors because betraying them pains my conscience.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(Tokita-kun, I'm sorry...)”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"As I close my eyes, I see his noble expression across the back of my eyelids.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In the end, people can only hold fast to that which they decide for themselves.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I have faith that you will eventually find an object worthy of your fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I look forward to seeing what you devote your fealty to.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"That's right.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"Even if the way that this all ends is already set in stone, as a parting gift, I should at least tell you the conclusion that you helped me arrive at.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"Shortly after ten of the clock, we meet for dinner to discuss our upcoming plans.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"Akari's mood seems to have taken a turn for the better after the incident at school today.",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"I only happened to be in the right place at the right time, but my lord still seems pleased by the fact that I rushed to her aid right away.",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I had no choice but to reveal the location of our headquarters to Elsa.”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"Hotori doesn't say anything.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"She crosses her arms in sullen contemplation.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now that she knows, what's done is done.”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just in case, we should change our muster point for the day of the uprising.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"On the day of the operation, our plan was to make our final preparations at headquarters before moving out.",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"But if Elsa springs an ambush on us there, it'll be a repeat of the August Incident, and we'll be wiped out for good.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You think Elsa's gonna betray us?”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, quite likely.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Or rather, it'd be more accurate to say that she planned to crush us from the very start.”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Got any proof?”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami reported in to me.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa apparently told the governor-general and Okonogi that she has a plan in place to wipe out the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She says it's just an excuse to deceive Okonogi, but Kanami thinks otherwise.”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Then it's better to be safe than sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm in favor of changing the muster point.”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"Akari silently nods her assent as well.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The question is, where should we assemble?”",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Republic's surveillance network is hard to shake. As soon as warriors start gathering, Elsa will catch wind of it right away.”",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			{
"The three of us stare at the map of Tenkyo on my tablet computer.",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			{
"A site close to the Imperial Palace where nearly two hundred armed warriors can assemble without arousing any suspicion.",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"Does a place that convenient even exist?",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
